{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception as separate automata. The specification encodes safe exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery turns are used only when obstacles are detected. Recovery is conservative and returns to exploration as soon as the path is clear. Full_rotate is reserved for repeated or ambiguous blockages.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to modularize sensing and actuation.",
    "Specification automaton enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward for progress, rotate to recover, and full_rotate only as last resort."
